SUMMARY:Intro to 3D Needle Felting with Karen Morgan
DESCRIPTION:September 26\, 2026\, 1 – 4 PM \nThis is a beginning level workshop.  Students will learn how to use the felting needle to manipulate the wool fiber to create an adorable owl\, penguin\, or gnome ornament. Learn how to create a basic shape and how to add different colors and additional shapes to create your very own felted figure. \nThe instructor will supply all the materials required to make your figure. She will have some additional fiber available for sale. \n$60 BSWG Members\n$70 BSWG Student Non-members (Includes one year membership)\n$90 BSWG Non-members (Includes one year membership) \n3-10 students \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/intro-to-3d-needle-felting-with-karen-morgan
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Ndle-Fltng-Karen-Morgan-Image-scaled-e1779815988473.jpg
END:VEVENT
