SUMMARY:Beginning Knitting with April Jennings\, Day 2
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, September 20th and Sunday\, September 27th\, 1:00-3:30 pm \nInterested in joining the exciting world of knitting?  In this 2-day course\, you will learn to cast-on\, knit stitch\, purl stitch\, and other skills to create your first knitting project! \nMaterial kit is included in the workshop fee. \nClass limited to 3-6 students. \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-knitting-with-april-jennings-day-2
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/092026-092726-Beg-knit-April-Jennings-Image-scaled-e1785167401435.jpg
END:VEVENT
