SUMMARY:Weaving on a 4-shaft Loom w/Peggy McIntosh\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Using a 4-shaft loom\, students will weave a chevron pattern scarf. \nStudents will need a 4-shaft loom with a 12-dent reed \nLooms may be rented from the guild or the instructor on a first-come\, first-served basis but supplies are limited.  Contact the Guild Librarian\, or the instructor at plmcintosh@gmail.com to rent a loom. \nRegister Here \n\n           Download QR
