UID:7294-1791633600-1791644400@bloomspinweave.org
SUMMARY:Stained Glass Rug Hooking w/Donna Jo Copeland
DESCRIPTION:October 10\, 2026\, 12-3 PM\nBasic rug hooking with fabric\, yarn\, (and) roving with a fall feel\, and yes\, a mirror too! Explore color\, texture all with one stitch. \nStudents will need to bring scissors and a 10-12” embroidery hoop. The instructor will be providing a kit as part of the workshop fee. The kit will include the linen\, fibers for hooking and the needle. \nFor more information and to register\, click here. \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/stained-glass-rug-hooking-w-donna-jo-copeland
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/101026-rug-hooking-Donna-Jo-Copeland-Pic-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
