SUMMARY:Knitted Pumpkin with April Jennings
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to create a beautiful\, textured knitted pumpkin featuring elegant cable details that add charm and dimension to your fall décor. In this beginner-to-intermediate class\, participants will learn cable knitting techniques\, shaping methods\, seaming\, stuffing\, and finishing touches to transform a simple knitted piece into a cozy seasonal decoration. \nFor more details and to register\, click here. \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/knitted-pumpkin-with-april-jennings
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/101026-knitted-pumpkin-April-Jennings-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
