SUMMARY:Beginning Granny Square Chickens with Lindsey Alumbaugh\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make a cute chicken out of only two simple crochet granny squares and a few extra stitches.  This is a beginner level class\, but anyone of any skill level is welcome.  Come knowing nothing about crochet and have a chicken by the end! \nThe workshop will take place over three Saturdays; October 11\, 18\, & 25\, 2026.  12-4 PM each day. \nSession 1: Learn basic crochet stitches and tension techniques \nRegister here. \n\n           Download QR
