SUMMARY:Bloomington Spinners & Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Holiday Show and Sale
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to announce the BSWG 2026 Holiday Show and Sale will be held on Friday\, November 6 (4 pm-9 pm) and Saturday\, November 7 (9 am-5 pm) at the Monroe Convention Center\, 306 S. College Avenue\, Bloomington\, IN.  Apply here. \nYou are cordially invited to apply to participate as a vendor in this year’s event. Booth fees for 2026 are:\nGuild Members​​ $135.00 (single booth)​​\, $68.00 each (shared booth)\nNon-guild members​ $145.00 (single booth)​​\, $73.00 each (shared booth) \nThe application deadline is August 14\, 2026.  Late applications will not be considered. \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/bloomington-spinners-weavers-fiber-arts-guild-holiday-show-and-sale
LOCATION:Monroe Convention Center\, 302 S. College Avenue\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47403\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
END:VEVENT
