SUMMARY:Introduction to Rigid Heddle Weaving w/Peggy McIntosh\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Using a rigid heddle loom\, students will learn the basics of weaving on a Rigid Heddle Loom. \nStudents will need a rigid heddle loom with a 7.5-dent or 8-dent heddle to fit the loom. \nLooms may be rented from the guild or the instructor on a first-come\, first-served basis but supplies are limited.  Contact the Guild Librarian or the instructor at plmcintosh@gmail.com\, to rent a loom. \nFor more information and to register\, click here. \n\n           Download QR
